\chapter*{Abstract}
This project analyzed systems of traffic ligths, roads and cars, in search of
the best startegy for controlling the traffic lights.  The problem was
analyzed and a simplified model was selected.  Simulation software was
developed for this model and run with many control strategies (due to time
constraints only simple strategies were tried).  This report documents what
was done and analyzes the results.

